+// Debounced reaper for empty workspaces. The switch itself must not
+// reap: the slides in the user config pass just-demoted workspaces
+// between monitors, and the OUT animation still reads the old
+// workspace's id — an immediate markInert invalidates it and flips
+// the animation direction. One timer, re-armed on every switch;
+// when it finally fires, tryReap re-checks activity, so workspaces
+// re-settled in the meantime are left alone.
+static SP<CEventLoopTimer> g_pEmptyWsReapTimer = nullptr;
